 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Pronouns with modal verbs",
     "texto": [
      "With modal verbs (**potere, volere, dovere**), the pronoun can go in two positions with the same meaning: **before the conjugated modal** (*La voglio vedere*) or **attached to the end of the infinitive** after dropping the -e (*Voglio vederla*)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Direct pronouns and passato prossimo",
     "texto": [
      "When the direct pronouns **lo, la, li, le** come before the passato prossimo: **lo** and **la** are elided to **l'** (*L'ho visto*, *L'ho vista*) and the past participle must agree with the object; **li** and **le** are not elided and keep the agreement (*Li ho visti*, *Le ho viste*)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Position with modals and agreement in the past",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "With the modal placed first",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "With the pronoun attached (enclitic)",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "Passato prossimo",
       "lengua": "estudio"
      }
     ],
